From e2eb1ca6873ecbb3c639cb93d00e2a8638dbbb03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlainBx20 <mnijli.m@societelemondeinformatique.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 10:07:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat: FTN frontend - full platform UI with improved
 modules

- Dashboard with gradient stat cards, upcoming/live competitions sections
- Clubs: card grid view with click-to-navigate, improved club detail with gradient header and colour-coded athlete categories
- Athlete detail with initials avatar and improved licence table
- Competitions: status filter tabs, Start/End action buttons, type badges
- Results: medal icons for top 3 ranks, competition filter dropdown
- Pools: card grid view with specs display
- Forum: expandable forum cards with topic list, new topic dialog
- App topbar: FTN branding

Co-Authored-By: AlainBx20 <mnijli.m@societelemondeinformatique.com>
