Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix: proper JWT auth flow replacing dev-token bypass

- auth.guard: validate JWT expiry instead of just checking token existence
- auth.interceptor: catch 401 responses, clear token and redirect to login
- auth.service: unwrap SingleResultDto from /auth/login response
- login: call real API, pre-fill admin creds, show error on failure

