+| source_url           | TEXT          | OUI      | ✅ AJOUT scraping  |
+| created_by           | BIGINT (FK)   | OUI      |                   |
+| status               | VARCHAR(50)   | NON      | défaut: PLANIFIEE |
+| created_at           | TIMESTAMP     | NON      |                   |
